{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensComponent\/documentation\/OUDSTokensComponent"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Library","externalID":"OUDSTokensComponent","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_design_token_figma_component.png"}],"modules":[{"name":"Tokens for components"}],"role":"collection","title":"Tokens for components","symbolKind":"module","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"Tokens for components"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"code":["🧬 Core version: 1.12.0"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Thus if a component need to change for example its "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"background color"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", and if a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component token"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" is used for it, then only the value of this "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"token","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" should be changed without any modification on the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"component","type":"text"}]},{"text":" definition.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Components"}]},{"text":" use ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component tokens"}]},{"text":" exposed through the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"theme","type":"text"}]},{"text":" thanks to token providers to get their style values.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Components tokens are defined and gathered inside ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift protocol","type":"text"}]},{"text":" so as to be exposed then through implementation of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"text":" thanks to dedicated tokens providers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Because we choose to split responsabilities and objects into their own modules, we faced troubles to make possible for children themes or providers to override properties declared in ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"protocols","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and defined in ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"extensions","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"That is the reason why tokens are exposed as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@objc open"},{"type":"text","text":" to be available and overridable anywhere."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Example with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensComponent\/documentation\/OUDSTokensComponent\/ButtonComponentTokens","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Declare some component tokens for buttons with properties they must apply","public protocol ButtonComponentTokens {","    var sizeMaxHeightIconOnly: SizeSemanticToken { get }","    var borderWidthDefault: BorderWidthSemanticToken { get }","    var borderRadius: BorderRadiusSemanticToken { get }","    var colorBgDefaultPressedMono: MultipleColorSemanticToken { get }","    var spacePaddingBlock: SpaceSemanticToken { get }","}","","\/\/ There is an existing provider for such tokens","open class OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider { }","","\/\/ Define the components tokens exposed through the theme thanks to provider","extension OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider: ButtonComponentTokens {","","    \/\/ Raw tokens can be used","","    @objc open var sizeMaxHeightIconOnly: SizeSemanticToken { DimensionRawTokens._600 }","    ","    \/\/ And also semantic tokens","","    @objc open var borderWidthDefault: BorderWidthSemanticToken { borders.widthThicker }","    @objc open var borderRadius: BorderRadiusSemanticToken { borders.radiusMedium }","    @objc open var colorBgDefaultPressedMono: MultipleColorSemanticToken { colors.repositoryOpacityBlackHigher }","    @objc open var spacePaddingBlock: SpaceSemanticToken { spaces.paddingInlineSpacious }","}","","\/\/ This provider is then exposed through OUDSTheme as an AllButtonComponentTokensProvider"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"How to use component tokens","anchor":"How-to-use-component-tokens"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In fact, the component tokens are declared and gathered in ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift protocol","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" so as to force any theme to implement them, and also to allow any theme to expose such properties whathever the implementation of the theme is, across providers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Because ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"component tokens","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" have for values ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"raw tokens","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"semantic tokens","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", and in the end for values primitive types, and all these tokens are declared with ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"type aliases","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" refering all together, you can handle a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"component token","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" directly in your view because the final value will be used.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Thus, get the theme and call the needed property with some helpers.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct SomeView: View {","","    @Environment(\\.theme) private var theme \/\/ Supposed you used in your root view the `OUDSThemeableView` to register the theme","    @Environment(\\.colorScheme) private var colorScheme","","    var body: some View {","        Button {","            \/\/ Some action","        } label: {","            Text(\"Some label\")","                .cornerRadius(theme.button.borderRadius)","        }","        .padding(.leading, theme.button.spacePaddingInlineChevronStartDefault)","        .padding(.trailing, theme.button.spacePaddingInlineChevronEndDefault)","        .background(theme.button.colorBgStrongEnabledMono)","        .overlay(","            RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: theme.button.borderRadius)","                .stroke(Color.blue, lineWidth: theme.button.borderWidthDefault)","        )","    }","\/*","    - The theme provides border semantic tokens \"borderRadius\" and \"borderWidthDefault\"","    - The theme provides a color semantic token \"colorBgStrongEnabledMono\"","    - The theme provides spaces semantic token \"spacePaddingInlineChevronStart\" and \"spacePaddingInlineChevronEnd\"","*\/","}","","\/\/ Do not forget in your app to use the `OUDSThemeableView` for your theme, e.g. `OrangeTheme`","@main","struct DesignToolbox: App {","","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            OUDSThemeableView(theme: OrangeTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","                ...","            }","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The components tokens are wrapped in tokens provider accessible through the themes:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Components tokens provider","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Target component","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"accordion \/ accordionFaq","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For accordions components","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"alert","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For alert mesdsages and inline alert components like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSAlertMessage"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSInlineAlert","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"bar","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For bars components like bottom and navigation bars","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"badge"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For badges like ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSBadgeStandard","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSBadgeIcon","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSBadgeCount","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"button","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For buttons like ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSButton","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"bulletList","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For list of elements with bullets like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSBulletList"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"card"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For card container components"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"checkbox"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For checkboxes like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSCheckbox"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSCheckboxItem"},{"type":"text","text":" and their indeterminate variants"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"chip"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For chips like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSuggestionChip"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSFilterChip"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"containedTabs"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For contained tabs components"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"divider","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For dividers like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSHorizontalDivider"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSVerticalDivider"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"icon","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For components containing icons like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTag"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"lineTabs","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For line tabs components","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"link","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For links like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSLink"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"listItem","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Shared and used for switch, checkbox, radio items and list items layouts","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"pinCodeInput","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"quantityInput","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"radioButton","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For radio components like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSRadio"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSRadioItem"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"selectInput","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"skeleton"}